Hi,

I'm using vesijama for sending emails, when I try to send mail with some central european charaters it doesn't work.

To fix it i had to change method setText in Mailer.java, i cannot override it since it is private.

I changed:

messagePart.setText(email.getText());

into

messagePart.setContent(email.getText(), &quot;text/plain; charset=\&quot;UTF-8\&quot;&quot;);


and also

messagePartHTML.setContent(email.getTextHTML(), &quot;text/html&quot;);

into

messagePartHTML.setContent(email.getTextHTML(), &quot;text/html; charset=\&quot;UTF-8\&quot;&quot;);


There seem to be other solutions with java mail but i can't use them with vesijama. 

Could you please support this in the library?
